# The e2e corpus fixtures are self-contained Bazel workspaces (each has its own
# MODULE.bazel) that the harness copies out and builds on its own. They must not
# be swept into this repo's //... .
e2e/testdata

# Where the harness materializes target repos when E2E_WORK_DIR points inside
# the workspace, as CI sets it.
.e2e

# The devcontainer's Bazel caches live here (see
# .devcontainer/init-bazel-caches.sh), and CI persists them with actions/cache.
# They hold BUILD files of their own, which //... must not sweep up.
.disk_cache
.bazel_cache

# Worktrees created by EnterWorktree are separate checkouts (with their own
# bazel-* output symlinks); they are not packages of this workspace.
.claude
